                        %mo )
                      %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P \coloneqq \eta^{\mu \nu} \frac{\partial}{\partial x^\mu}\frac{\partial}{\partial x^\nu} - \left( \tfrac{m c}{\hbar} \right)^2
              be the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Klein-Gordon+operator"} Klein-Gordon operator
              = succeed "." do
