          %p
            A key fact for identifying
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wave+front+sets"} wave front sets
            is the
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/propagation+of+singularities+theorem"} propagation of singularities theorem
            (prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PropagationOfSingularitiesTheorem"}
            below). In order to state this we need the following concepts regarding symbols of differential operators:
          #SymbolOfADifferentialOperator.num_defn
            %h6#definition_10 Definition
            %p
              %strong
