                    \&amp; =
                    \\int_{-\infty}^\infty
                    \\sin\left(
                    \\sqrt{ - {\vert x-y\vert}^2_\eta }
                    \\tfrac{m c}{\hbar}
                    \\left(
                    \\cosh(z \pm \tau)
                    \\right)
                    \\right)
                    \\, d z
                    \\\
                    \&amp; =
                    \\pi J_0\left( \sqrt{ - {\vert x-y\vert}^2_\eta} \tfrac{m c}{\hbar} \right)
                    \\end{aligned}
                    \\,.
