            %p
              by computing an explicit form for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causal+propagator"} causal propagator
              in terms of the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delta+distribution"} delta distribution
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Heaviside+distribution"} Heaviside distribution
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+function"} smooth
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bessel+functions"} Bessel functions
            %p
              We follow (
              %a{:href => "causal+perturbation+theory#Scharf95"}> Scharf 95 (2.3.36)
              ).
            %p
              By
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:SymmetricPartOfHadamardPropagatorForKleinGordonOnMinkowskiSpacetime"} (26)
              we have
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable{:columnalign => "right left right left right left right left right left", :columnspacing => "0em", :displaystyle => "true"}
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %msub
                              %mi Δ
                              %mi H
