            %p
              where we identified the integral representations of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neumann+function"} Neumann function
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi N
                      %mn 0
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N_0
              (see
              = succeed ")" do
